(text "Battery output: U3 IN tied to VS; DIAG_EN grounded, FAULT unconnected.\nTI supports this standalone connection. 3.9k sets the current limit; 33nF sets latch delay.\nCycle board power after correcting an overload. Powered sensor ports remain live during MCU reset." (at 25 105 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "900d4731-b004-52ca-9c15-5db907ab23b4"))
(text "Regulated output: TPS2553-1 latch-off version, EN tied to its input.\n59k current-limit resistor. Cycle board power to clear overload.\nDesign target: 300mA combined sensor load per rail, not per connector.\nDo not back-power the sensor supply outputs." (at 25 227 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9373aa2-0f6d-5e05-a772-3bccc93a2224"))
(embedded_fonts no))
